    "steam_appid": 2990360,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990360/extras/fbc470fc3a07d30c9cbb252804e9d330.poster.avif?t=1754177836\" width=614 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990360/extras/fbc470fc3a07d30c9cbb252804e9d330.webm?t=1754177836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990360/extras/fbc470fc3a07d30c9cbb252804e9d330.mp4?t=1754177836\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nemiza has spoken their verdict. Everybody's<strong> </strong>soul is scattered. Once human, you now take on the twisted catacombs of Lovence as one of the unfortunate to settle into a new monstrous body. Survive as an undead,  fight as a naga or turn into a parasitic mushroom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reject or embrace your new form, and hunt down Nemiza in the distorted labyrinth to challenge their verdict.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Evolve or Learn</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make the most of your limited time until you inevitably succumb to your instincts. Evolve your new body and master its grotesque physique or rembember your former past and recover long lost skills. Humanity or bestiality \u2013 Your decision.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >As a horde</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fortunately you're not alone in this misery. Play together with your friends and form a team up to 3 players.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990360/extras/fbc470fc3a07d30c9cbb252804e9d330.poster.avif?t=1754177836\" width=614 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990360/extras/fbc470fc3a07d30c9cbb252804e9d330.webm?t=1754177836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990360/extras/fbc470fc3a07d30c9cbb252804e9d330.mp4?t=1754177836\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nemiza has spoken their verdict. Everybody's<strong> </strong>soul is scattered. Once human, you now take on the twisted catacombs of Lovence as one of the unfortunate to settle into a new monstrous body. Survive as an undead,  fight as a naga or turn into a parasitic mushroom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reject or embrace your new form, and hunt down Nemiza in the distorted labyrinth to challenge their verdict.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Evolve or Learn</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make the most of your limited time until you inevitably succumb to your instincts. Evolve your new body and master its grotesque physique or rembember your former past and recover long lost skills. Humanity or bestiality \u2013 Your decision.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >As a horde</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fortunately you're not alone in this misery. Play together with your friends and form a team up to 3 players.</p>",
    "short_description": "Nemiza's Verdict is a cooperative roguelite dungeon crawler where your soul takes over various monstrosities. Hunt down Nemiza and challenge their verdict in the twisted labyrinth of Lovence by evolving your monstrous abilities and remember skills from your past life.",
